<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Nothing between, like worldly pleasure;</l><l>Habits of life, though harmless they seem,</l><l>Must not my heart from Him e’er sever;</l><l>He is my all, there’s nothing between.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Nothing between, like pride or station;</l><l>Self-life or friends shall not intervene;</l><l>Though it may cost me much tribulation,</l><l>I am resolved; there’s nothing between.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Nothing between, e’en many hard trials,</l><l>Though the whole world against me convene;</l><l>Watching with prayer and much self-denial,</l><l>I’ll triumph at last, with nothing between.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
